OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in Need red sofa push    
OL,4,Araises #200,000                        
OL,6,FThe Push for Pudsey Look North sofa    
OL,7,Fchallenge has raised more than #200,000
OL,8,Ffor BBC Children In Need.              
OL,10,FLindsey Burrow, the widow of rugby     
OL,11,Fleague legend and MND campaigner Rob   
OL,12,FBurrow, and Look North presenter Amy   
OL,13,FGarcia hauled the programme's red sofa 
OL,14,F80 miles around North, South and West  
OL,15,FYorkshire from 9-13 November.          
OL,17,FThe challenge took them from Ripon to  
OL,18,FWakefield Trinity's Belle Vue Stadium  
OL,19,Fand took five days, raising a total of 
OL,20,F#226,656.                              
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
