OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in Need red sofa push    
OL,4,Araises #200,000                        
OL,6,FLindsey said she was "incredibly proud"
OL,7,Fof the amount raised and it was "an    
OL,8,Fhonour and a privilege to be part of   
OL,9,Fthe Push for Pudsey team this year".   
